OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested over sexual abuse at
OL,4,Achildren's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested as part
OL,7,Fof an investigation into historical
OL,8,Fchild sex abuse at a council-run
OL,9,Fchildren's care home in Bradford.
OL,11,FA 63-year-old man and a 60-year-old
OL,12,Fwoman were arrested at addresses in
OL,13,FBradford and Manchester on 10 September
OL,14,Fand released on bail, according to West
OL,15,FYorkshire Police.
OL,17,FThe force said two men and three women
OL,18,Fclaimed to have been sexually abused at
OL,19,FSaxton Avenue Children's Home in the
OL,20,F1980s and 1990s when they were aged
OL,21,Fbetween seven and 16.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
